WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.707
Module 14 is the final project.

00:00:02.707 --> 00:00:09.157
You will bring together the course skills: understanding data, preparing it, writing SQL, validating outputs,

00:00:09.157 --> 00:00:10.732
and communicating results.

00:00:10.732 --> 00:00:18.857
The Spark SQL ideas from this module give you one more option for thinking about analytical scale,

00:00:18.857 --> 00:00:23.507
but the core habits remain the same: know your data, state the grain, validate your work,

00:00:23.507 --> 00:00:30.992
and explain your decisions. As you move forward, keep the reasoning habits from this module.

00:00:30.992 --> 00:00:36.547
The next topic will add new SQL tools, but it still depends on understanding grain, missing values,

00:00:36.547 --> 00:00:39.600
and the meaning of each transformation.
